{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Villa Nocturne</i> is a slow-burning psychological horror experience focused on atmosphere, sound, and emotional tension.<br>This demo offers a glimpse into the unsettling world of the game \u2014 a decaying mansion filled with whispers, memories, and shadows that refuse to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short preview, you\u2019ll explore the early sections of the house, uncover its eerie ambience, and get a feel for the game\u2019s immersive audio design and visual tone.<br>There are no cheap scares here \u2014 just a lingering sense of dread that follows your every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback means everything. This demo is only the beginning \u2014 a taste of what\u2019s to come when <i>Villa Nocturne</i> releases in full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129840?t=1762339102","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129840?t=1762339102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129840/4244bbb293847a5c4488fa8deed3c8e4c2dfe55f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762339102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129840/4244bbb293847a5c4488fa8deed3c8e4c2dfe55f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762339102","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of blood and violence, depictions of corpses, accidental deaths, and injuries. The dark and oppressive atmosphere includes horror elements and jumpscares that may be disturbing to some players. Certain scenes also imply the use of alcohol or tobacco."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragra